- **Weight Decay:**
  - Weight decay values of 3e-05 and 0.0003 tended to perform better than 0.003. Trials with weight decay set to 3e-05 or 0.0003 achieved Dice scores above 81, while the trial with a weight decay of 0.003 had a significantly lower score of 60.0.

